      "contextTags": ["afternoon", "clinic", "low_mood"],
      "text": "二十分钟午休变成了五分钟，胸口又有点闷——再忍一忍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "monologue_lena_late_clinic",
      "contextTags": ["evening", "clinic", "low_energy"],
      "text": "灯下记最后两份病例，今天又比昨天晚了三十分钟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "monologue_lena_post_event",
      "contextTags": ["evening", "tavern", "post_event", "low_mood"],
      "text": "争执之后没人再注意奥蕾娅的脸色变了几次，可我看到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "monologue_lena_high_mood",
      "contextTags": ["evening", "clinic", "high_mood"],
      "text": "今天没有急诊，没有胸闷，没有坏消息——这种日子值得记上一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "monologue_lena_with_player",
